<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan cotton output to mid-March below year-ago.</title>
<headline>Pakistan cotton output to mid-March below year-ago.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's 1996/97 (July/June) cotton output reached 8.64 million 375-lb bales by March 15, down from 9.81 million bales at the same time a year ago, the Pakistan Cotton Ginners Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Delivery and ginning figures in million bales (year-ago) -</p>
<p>		    Punjab	   Sindh	    Total</p>
<p> Delivery	 6.574 (8.084)  2.068 (1.734)  8.640 (9.810)</p>
<p> Pressed	  6.525 (8.048)  2.032 (1.677)  8.557 (9.720)</p>
<p> Mill sales     5.418 (6.428)  1.802 (1.146)  7.220 (7.574)</p>
<p> Export sales   0.008 (0.935)  0.002 (0.405)  0.010 (1.340)</p>
<p> CEC		nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)</p>
<p> Unsold	   1.140 (0.720)  0.270 (0.180)  1.410 (0.903)</p>
<p>--Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192.</p>
</text>
